{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2444340/extras/ff998508aff9cedca0318455effa6400.avif?t=1772489162\" width=630 height=80 /></span><br><br>You are <strong>Dvalloc</strong>, a dwarf living in an underground village.<br>One day, the dwarven miners dig too deep and uncover a <strong>cursed rune</strong>...<br>Apart from nearly destroying the village, it corrupts everyone there. As you're the only one who survived, it becomes your mission to <strong>save the dwarves</strong> and <strong>rebuild your village</strong>.<br><br>Search for the corrupted dwarves in deep caverns beneath your home. Mine gems, crystals and other resources to bring them back to the village and restore it to its former glory!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2444340/extras/728dbb4880fb6d305fc4217fb1267cf8.avif?t=1772489162\" width=630 height=80 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore a vast, underground world divided into <strong>various areas</strong>.<br></li><li>Fight a diverse cast of enemies using different <strong>dwarven weapons</strong>.<br></li><li>Defeat <strong>powerful bosses</strong> to free them from the corruption.<br></li><li>Manage your health by assigning <strong>heart crystals</strong> with unique abilities.<br></li><li>Rescue your dwarven friends to speak to them and <strong>purchase items or upgrades</strong>.<br></li><li><strong>Rebuild the village</strong> one building at a time.<br></li><li>Acquire new <strong>movement abilities</strong> such as double jump, dash and wall jump!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2444340/extras/22b9a99d0b3ebde7552fc2551713abc7.avif?t=1772489162\" width=630 height=80 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Satisfying, responsive movement<br></li><li>Beautiful pixelart graphics<br></li><li>4 vastly different areas to explore<br></li><li>More than 10 types of enemies<br></li><li>9+ dangerous bosses<br></li><li>4 different weapons<br></li><li>An engaging story of a dwarven village</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2444340?t=1772489162","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2444340/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772489162","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2444340/091b6a9abf11f9a60834f7a4594dfb17fd8716b3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772489162","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2444340/091b6a9abf11f9a60834f7a4594dfb17fd8716b3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772489162","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4418760,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2444340/extras/ff998508aff9cedca0318455effa6400.avif?t=1772489162\" width=630 height=80 /></span><br><br>You are <strong>Dvalloc</strong>, a dwarf living in an underground village.<br>One day, the dwarven miners dig too deep and uncover a <strong>cursed rune</strong>...<br>Apart from nearly destroying the village, it corrupts everyone there. As you're the only one who survived, it becomes your mission to <strong>save the dwarves</strong> and <strong>rebuild your village</strong>.<br><br>Search for the corrupted dwarves in deep caverns beneath your home. Mine gems, crystals and other resources to bring them back to the village and restore it to its former glory!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/